      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAPER SHREDDER (5) failed to feature last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won by a nose at this track (23.28) beating Wonky Key Donkey in a Mix 3/4 on July 31. Has a solid record from this box including four wins and a minor placing. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. FASCINATE GLORY (4) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 23.01 beating Jungle Tiger. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. GREAT FLASH (2) has a strong record this trip with 13 wins and seven placings from 39 starts. Hit the frame latest (23.23) when third at this track in a Mix 2/3. Looks one of the chances. ROB YOU BLIND (8) is a last-start placegetter as favourite - should be thereabouts.",
